Primary Goal – What’s the main outcome you want from lineage/metadata (e.g., compliance/audit, faster troubleshooting, data discovery, governance, ownership tracking)?
	2.	Scope of Systems – Which systems or data sources should we prioritize first (Postgres, Cassandra, ETL jobs, dashboards, APIs)?
	3.	Level of Detail – Do you need lineage at a high level (system → system) or more granular (table/column-level)?
	4.	Timeliness – Should lineage updates be real-time or is batch/daily refresh acceptable?
	5.	User Access – How do you expect end-users to interact with this (through a UI catalog, embedded in dashboards, API integration)?
	6.	Governance Needs – Do you also need data access controls, business metadata, and ownership visibility, or mainly technical lineage?
	7.	Priorities – If we can only deliver one capability first, which is most valuable to you:
	•	Lineage visualization
	•	Data catalog/discovery
	•	Data quality monitoring
	•	Governance/ownership tracking

